        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana PPH3515/DP2574, Solid Brass Pull Plate 3-1/2\" Wide x 15\" High With 9\" Solid Brass Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis solid brass door pull plate with 9\" pull handle is available in 7 great finishes. Packaged with matching finish mounting screws for easy installation.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: Matching <a href=\"/products/push-plate-3-5-x-15-inches-solid-brass-deltana-pp3515\"><b>Deltana 3-1/2\" x 15\" Push Plate</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThese brass push plates are manufactured by Deltana, the nation\u0019s most complete provider of all of your door hardware needs.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications:</b> for Deltana PPH3515/DP2574 Pull Plate\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 15\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Thickness: .050\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Length: 8-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Mounting Centers: 8\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-PPH3515-DP2574.pdf?v=1704262212\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana PPH3515/DP2574 Dimensional Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
